# route: level=w5_l1 difficulty=expert ends=exit after=tally expect=hurts:0,min_checkpoints:4,min_kills:9,min_score:12000
# The Expert club route of Red Mesa Trail (designer D5): the Beginner line plus the Expert spawn set - the desert eagle
# that trails the hero from the rattler hill, a rattler at the tunnel exit, a Roller on the plain, a Roller half way
# up the long climb and a tortoise on the mesa top. Never presses S, never takes the spear (belt invariance).
# The beach and the first tortoise (the crate opens with the same swing)
77:R,8:F,2:
# over the red rock, the rattler on the hill (the eagle wakes and trails behind)
6:R,8:RU,12:R,6:,10:R,6:,6:R,8:F,2:
# the second tortoise, checkpoint 1, the arch, the first Roller jumped
16:R,8:F,2:,60:R,44:,14:RU,8:R
# up the mesa steps to checkpoint 2, over the crevasse, the plateau tortoise
6:R,10:RU,6:R,14:RU,22:R,10:RU,28:R,14:RU,7:R,8:F
# the lower tunnel, the rattler at its mouth, checkpoint 3, the plateau Roller jumped, the plain tortoise
35:R,8:F,18:R,20:,14:RU,51:R,8:F
# the plain Roller jumped where it meets the hero, into the gully: two tortoises, checkpoint 4
17:,14:U,4:,56:R,8:F,28:R,8:F
# the long climb: two Rollers come down one after the other, the third on the top is bounced on
90:R,6:,14:U,14:,14:U,4:,26:R,12:,14:U
# the two tortoises of the mesa top, the exit totem
12:R,8:F,12:R,8:F,50:R
